124	        // system far from both the seeded Legor admin account (1:1:2) and any planets
125	        // leaked by non-transactional tests (Admin/Ban/Buddy populate systems 1..N).
126	        // Without this, position-based colonisation tests collide with Legor's 1:1:2, and
127	        // the distance between the two home planets drifts (raising deuterium fuel past
